# Trial-Size Trial by Ice (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_ice): entryRequirement. Main, a level 20 Warrior with the quest accepted and
# the MiniTuningForkOfIce: IP_Entrance: not a Summoner: no options: the default. bob, a level 19 Summoner: below 20: no options.
lists CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrade
char zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=558.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=20
char bob zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=558.5,-0.8,600.0 job=SMN lvl=19
quest Sandoria.TrialSizeTrialByIce accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfIce
bob: item MiniTuningForkOfIce
login
trade IP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfIce x1  # not a Summoner: no options
bob: login
bob: trade IP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfIce x1  # level 19: no options
